  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Uninstall Nix (if necessary)",
      "source_hash": 1373994873023546332,
      "context_hash": 1637521789723344229,
      "translation": "Nix 제거하기(필요한 경우)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nix": "Nix"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:57.889489Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Cleanly remove Nix from your system",
      "source_hash": 13799379503772800861,
      "context_hash": 715863359689646537,
      "translation": "시스템에서 Nix를 깔끔하게 제거하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nix": "Nix"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:57.889491Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "At the beginning of the Zero to Nix quick start, we [installed] Nix using the fast and stable [Determinate Nix Installer][nix-installer], from [Determinate Systems][ds].",
      "source_hash": 1460606199018436671,
      "context_hash": 9591017128245389089,
      "translation": "Zero to Nix 빠른 시작의 시작 부분에서, 저희는 [Determinate Systems][ds]의 빠르고 안정적인 [Determinate Nix Installer][nix-installer]를 사용하여 Nix를 [설치했습니다][installed].",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "nix-installer": "nix-installer",
        "Determinate Nix": "Determinate Nix",
        "quick start": "빠른 시작",
        "Determinate Systems": "Determinate Systems",
        "Determinate Nix Installer": "Determinate Nix Installer",
        "Nix": "Nix"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:57.889491Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "We hope that your journey with Nix continues well into the future, but if you need to uninstall Nix for any reason you can do so with this command:",
      "source_hash": 3736236947377508149,
      "context_hash": 15250583652769003429,
      "translation": "Nix와 함께하는 여정이 앞으로도 계속 순조롭기를 바라지만, 어떤 이유로든 Nix를 제거해야 한다면 다음 명령으로 제거할 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nix": "Nix"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:57.889493Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Follow the prompts to approve the requested changes.",
      "source_hash": 6754007900081425126,
      "context_hash": 8663787481344638226,
      "translation": "프롬프트를 따라 요청된 변경 사항을 승인하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:57.889493Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "Some of the changes that the installer requests:",
      "source_hash": 2398566059396395078,
      "context_hash": 8342765496205897732,
      "translation": "설치 프로그램이 요청하는 변경 사항 중 일부는 다음과 같습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:57.889494Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Delete the directory tree under `/nix`",
      "source_hash": 416792130551676185,
      "context_hash": 16343411869461962131,
      "translation": "`/nix` 아래의 디렉터리 트리 삭제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:57.889494Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Delete the [Nix] CLI tool",
      "source_hash": 11434102408461242823,
      "context_hash": 12968857224640389274,
      "translation": "[Nix] CLI 도구 삭제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nix": "Nix"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:57.889494Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Delete all Nix-specific users and groups",
      "source_hash": 8185456163012290787,
      "context_hash": 5695137840408892953,
      "translation": "Nix 전용 사용자 및 그룹 전체 삭제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nix": "Nix"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:57.889495Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Delete the Nix configuration file at `/etc/nix/nix.conf`",
      "source_hash": 4242925333436735728,
      "context_hash": 331211200594213968,
      "translation": "`/etc/nix/nix.conf`에 있는 Nix 설정 파일 삭제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nix": "Nix",
        "configuration": "설정"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:57.889495Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "Once the Determinate Nix Installer is done, you can verify that uninstallation has succeeded by confirming that directories like `/nix` and `~/.nix-profile` have been removed from your system:",
      "source_hash": 4418627573564422789,
      "context_hash": 6196887875777960047,
      "translation": "Determinate Nix Installer가 완료되면, `/nix`와 `~/.nix-profile` 같은 디렉터리가 시스템에서 제거되었는지 확인하여 제거가 성공했는지 검증할 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Determinate Nix": "Determinate Nix",
        "Determinate Nix Installer": "Determinate Nix Installer",
        "Nix": "Nix"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T14:55:57.889496Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}